**Verdict on the claim: refuted.** Eleven cycles since the 2026-09-28 review (117 through 127) produced four more structural VI files that have never executed, and nothing the user can run that they could not run on 09-28. This is the third consecutive outcome review to reach that conclusion.

Limits: `claudeDev\` is outside the repository, so file states are as the logs record them. Cycle 120's cost is unrecorded (`tools/bench/cycle_runner.log:803`), so dollar totals are floors. No external sources were needed.

